WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.380
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.650 --> 01:48.020
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.080 --> 01:51.090
[Episode 20]

4
01:59.120 --> 01:59.560
You...

5
02:02.700 --> 02:04.140
You're still awake?

6
02:08.280 --> 02:09.610
I actually fell asleep.

7
02:10.690 --> 02:12.900
Is this movie that bad?

8
02:27.370 --> 02:28.430
When I'm with you,

9
02:29.870 --> 02:31.329
I fall asleep more easily.

10
02:33.120 --> 02:33.860
Hmm.

11
02:45.750 --> 02:46.710
Fireworks.

12
02:47.360 --> 02:48.590
Look, fireworks!

13
02:49.210 --> 02:51.180
Come on. Let's go watch the fireworks!

14
02:51.180 --> 02:52.380
Hurry, take me there.

15
02:53.060 --> 02:54.680
Hurry, let's go.

16
02:55.970 --> 02:56.590
Let's go.

17
03:07.190 --> 03:08.130
So beautiful.

18
03:09.320 --> 03:10.110
Yeah.

19
03:10.530 --> 03:11.420
It really is.

20
03:22.530 --> 03:23.440
Look at that one.

21
03:23.440 --> 03:24.440
So cool.

22
03:28.630 --> 03:29.430
Yeah.

23
03:29.780 --> 03:30.860
It really is cool.

24
03:48.400 --> 03:50.240
There are a lot of people today.

25
03:53.790 --> 03:55.290
There really are.

26
03:57.430 --> 03:59.310
How do you usually

27
03:59.340 --> 04:00.130
celebrate the New Year?

28
04:00.130 --> 04:01.870
Do you watch the fireworks every year?

29
04:01.870 --> 04:03.680
When I was in college, I spent New Year's with Xia.

30
04:03.680 --> 04:05.410
Sometimes, I spent it on my own.

31
04:05.800 --> 04:08.860
But this is the first time I've ever watched fireworks.

32
04:38.930 --> 04:39.740
From now on,

33
04:40.520 --> 04:42.380
let's spend New Year's together.

34
04:43.930 --> 04:44.740
Sure.

35
04:52.740 --> 04:53.600
Happy New Year.

36
04:56.100 --> 04:57.040
Happy New Year.

37
05:26.600 --> 05:27.970
Do you have any wishes

38
05:28.000 --> 05:29.330
for the new year?

39
05:32.490 --> 05:33.290
Do you?

40
05:34.110 --> 05:35.409
I wish...

41
05:37.690 --> 05:39.070
I just wish

42
05:39.810 --> 05:42.070
for you to keep liking me a little longer.

43
05:44.570 --> 05:46.170
I'm sure that will come true.

44
05:50.040 --> 05:50.900
What about you?

45
05:52.480 --> 05:54.480
I hope everything goes well for you.

46
06:03.180 --> 06:04.180
Happy New Year.

47
06:05.430 --> 06:06.690
Another sneak attack?

48
06:07.500 --> 06:09.180
When else did I do a sneak attack?

49
06:09.180 --> 06:09.930
You did.

50
06:10.670 --> 06:12.070
That time you were drunk.

51
06:12.930 --> 06:13.390
When...

52
06:13.680 --> 06:14.740
When I was drunk...

53
06:16.270 --> 06:17.980
that doesn't count.

54
06:19.070 --> 06:21.600
Besides, who knows who made the first move...

55
06:49.000 --> 06:49.830
You're back.

56
06:52.180 --> 06:53.640
Your sister is still here.

57
06:54.680 --> 06:55.630
Where have you two been?

58
06:55.630 --> 06:56.960
Why are you back so late?

59
06:59.670 --> 07:00.740
Watching fireworks.

60
07:00.740 --> 07:02.270
We went to watch fireworks.

61
07:04.170 --> 07:05.030
Let me help you.

62
07:05.720 --> 07:07.620
I forgot it was New Year's Eve.

63
07:07.980 --> 07:08.630
Tangy,

64
07:08.660 --> 07:09.380
why didn't you ask me

65
07:09.380 --> 07:11.180
to spend New Year's Eve with you?

66
07:11.390 --> 07:12.930
I was too busy. I forgot.

67
07:13.600 --> 07:14.730
Just put them there.

68
07:20.770 --> 07:21.830
Lili, you're back.

69
07:28.370 --> 07:29.970
What's going on with you two?

70
07:35.270 --> 07:36.270
Isn't it obvious?

71
07:38.630 --> 07:39.930
You guys are together?

72
07:49.500 --> 07:50.300
So are we.

73
08:12.180 --> 08:13.040
Tell me.

74
08:13.300 --> 08:14.570
What's going on?

75
08:16.740 --> 08:17.540
Well...

76
08:18.080 --> 08:19.260
we met,

77
08:19.780 --> 08:21.430
and then...

78
08:23.440 --> 08:25.200
we just got together.

79
08:29.090 --> 08:29.890
Same here.

80
08:32.919 --> 08:33.980
Don't interrupt.

81
08:34.630 --> 08:35.600
One at a time.

82
08:35.929 --> 08:36.860
You two go first.

83
08:38.480 --> 08:39.940
When did you get together?

84
08:41.580 --> 08:43.340
We only got together today.

85
08:44.290 --> 08:45.790
You just got together today?

86
08:45.790 --> 08:46.790
It's true.

87
08:47.500 --> 08:48.700
We just got together.

88
08:49.240 --> 08:50.030
Tangy.

89
08:54.330 --> 08:55.560
You knew it all along.

90
08:57.300 --> 08:59.230
So I'm the only one who didn't know.

91
09:01.840 --> 09:02.600
You two have been

92
09:02.600 --> 09:04.290
right under my nose this whole time.

93
09:04.290 --> 09:05.440
How did you two manage

94
09:05.440 --> 09:07.500
to get together without me noticing?

95
09:07.670 --> 09:09.570
We're like dry tinder and a blazing fire.

96
09:09.570 --> 09:11.170
We couldn't help ourselves.

97
09:14.390 --> 09:15.000
Congsheng,

98
09:15.000 --> 09:16.070
enough about us.

99
09:16.070 --> 09:17.000
Look over there.

100
09:17.100 --> 09:17.870
Look at them.

101
09:17.980 --> 09:19.780
They're already holding hands!

102
09:21.600 --> 09:22.660
What about you two?

103
09:22.700 --> 09:24.100
What's your situation?

104
09:26.340 --> 09:27.130
Lili.

105
09:27.240 --> 09:28.600
You're amazing.

106
09:28.630 --> 09:31.090
You even managed to get Uncle to fall for you.

107
09:31.230 --> 09:33.460
Not really. It wasn't that hard.

108
09:34.730 --> 09:36.390
When did you two start dating?

109
09:37.480 --> 09:39.680
After that trip to the hot spring hotel.

110
09:41.980 --> 09:43.750
Did Lili make the first move?

111
09:44.050 --> 09:44.860
I courted her.

112
09:53.050 --> 09:55.910
All of a sudden, there are two more couples around me.

113
09:55.910 --> 09:57.050
It seems like my guesthouse

114
09:57.050 --> 09:58.650
is a lucky place for romance.

115
10:03.250 --> 10:04.320
It's New Year's Eve, too.

116
10:04.320 --> 10:05.220
Two joys at once!

117
10:05.220 --> 10:06.550
Let's have a drink together.

118
10:06.550 --> 10:07.290
Sure.

119
10:07.290 --> 10:08.000
Cheers.

120
10:08.050 --> 10:08.790
Cheers.

121
10:08.790 --> 10:09.700
Happy New Year.

122
10:19.720 --> 10:20.920
I'll get going, Lili.

123
10:21.220 --> 10:22.010
I'll be there in a moment.

124
10:22.010 --> 10:22.440
Okay.

125
10:48.600 --> 10:49.730
What are you eating?

126
10:51.120 --> 10:52.200
You scared me.

127
10:52.500 --> 10:53.460
Why are you here?

128
10:54.860 --> 10:55.650
So,

129
10:56.000 --> 10:58.060
what are you treating me to for lunch?

130
10:58.400 --> 11:00.550
The company's packed lunch.

131
11:03.100 --> 11:04.530
Then dinner's on me tonight.

132
11:04.530 --> 11:05.590
What are we eating?

133
11:05.750 --> 11:08.150
That restaurant we missed out on last time.

134
11:10.010 --> 11:10.670
Yun Li.

135
11:12.750 --> 11:13.550
Engineer Fu?

136
11:13.860 --> 11:14.820
You're here too.

137
11:16.700 --> 11:17.980
I'll come back later, then.

138
11:17.980 --> 11:19.300
I'm just about to leave.

139
11:19.300 --> 11:20.760
I'll leave you two to talk.

140
11:28.960 --> 11:29.750
Yun Li.

141
11:30.340 --> 11:32.070
Was that Engineer Fu being shy?

142
11:34.010 --> 11:34.820
Was he?

143
11:37.390 --> 11:38.050
Jiameng.

144
11:38.050 --> 11:39.150
which restaurant did Engineer Fu

145
11:39.150 --> 11:41.010
ask you to book?

146
11:41.150 --> 11:41.860
Let me tell you,

147
11:41.860 --> 11:43.310
the food there is really expensive!

148
11:43.310 --> 11:44.500
You have to book a table

149
11:44.500 --> 11:45.550
a week in advance.

150
11:46.550 --> 11:47.880
Didn't you go last time?

151
11:49.720 --> 11:51.250
He's taking me there today.

152
11:51.860 --> 11:52.650
Yun Li,

153
11:52.670 --> 11:54.930
you have to seize the opportunity.

154
12:08.390 --> 12:09.830
I recommend this one for winter.

155
12:09.830 --> 12:11.150
It has notes of chestnut and cashmere wood,

156
12:11.150 --> 12:12.950
which gives it a warm, cozy feel.

157
12:13.650 --> 12:15.850
This one with iris notes is also lovely.

158
12:15.960 --> 12:18.600
I'm looking for something for my boyfriend.

159
12:20.340 --> 12:22.410
This one with leather and woody notes is a good choice.

160
12:22.410 --> 12:23.240
Really?

161
12:25.370 --> 12:27.720
Do you have anything that might help

162
12:27.720 --> 12:29.290
people relax and sleep better?

163
12:29.290 --> 12:30.820
Then I'd recommend this one with vetiver.

164
12:30.820 --> 12:32.610
It has notes of lemon and lemongrass,

165
12:32.610 --> 12:34.540
and it's a good choice for men, too.

166
12:36.000 --> 12:37.330
I... I'll take this one!

167
12:37.700 --> 12:38.460
Of course. Just a moment.

168
12:38.460 --> 12:39.720
I'll wrap it up for you.

169
12:42.290 --> 12:43.600
Focus on your work today.

170
12:43.600 --> 12:44.390
Don't wait for me.

171
12:44.390 --> 12:46.050
I'll go there by myself later.

172
12:46.460 --> 12:47.890
You're heading over this early?

173
12:47.890 --> 12:49.550
I'm shopping at Haitian Mall.

174
12:50.050 --> 12:51.290
Buying a gift for me?

175
12:52.050 --> 12:52.910
No.

176
12:54.890 --> 12:56.290
You always figure me out.

177
12:56.290 --> 12:58.020
You always spoil the surprise.

178
13:00.150 --> 13:01.460
Then I'll come over now.

179
13:01.460 --> 13:01.980
Okay.

180
13:05.080 --> 13:06.010
Catch the thief!

181
13:36.650 --> 13:37.320
Hello?

182
13:37.720 --> 13:38.320
Lili.

183
13:39.410 --> 13:40.170
I'm almost there.

184
13:40.170 --> 13:41.050
Where are you?

185
13:41.550 --> 13:42.460
I'm at...

186
13:42.870 --> 13:44.220
the bus stop

187
13:44.220 --> 13:45.460
across from Haitian Mall.

188
13:45.460 --> 13:46.000
Okay.

189
13:46.650 --> 13:47.620
Fu Shize,

190
13:48.270 --> 13:49.150
could you go to the restaurant

191
13:49.150 --> 13:50.960
and wait for me there?

192
13:51.050 --> 13:51.860
What's wrong?

193
13:54.980 --> 13:57.120
Lili, what happened?

194
13:57.250 --> 13:58.410
Nothing. Just...

195
13:58.700 --> 14:00.630
I had a bit of an incident.

196
14:02.750 --> 14:03.550
Lili.

197
14:04.070 --> 14:05.070
Wait for me there.

198
14:05.250 --> 14:06.380
I'll be right there.

199
14:41.000 --> 14:42.530
What happened to your hand?

200
14:47.050 --> 14:48.710
The gift I bought for you

201
14:49.010 --> 14:50.370
got broken when I fell.

202
14:51.980 --> 14:52.770
I'm fine.

203
14:53.130 --> 14:54.170
I just fell.

204
14:54.730 --> 14:56.090
It's just a scrape.

205
14:56.120 --> 14:57.400
Are you hurt anywhere else?

206
14:57.400 --> 14:58.930
No, nowhere else.

207
14:59.130 --> 15:01.790
I'll just put some ointment on it when I get home.

208
15:01.890 --> 15:02.480
Let's go.

209
15:04.130 --> 15:05.250
Come on, get in.

210
15:35.850 --> 15:38.850
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

211
15:41.840 --> 15:42.440
Tangy.

212
15:42.750 --> 15:43.890
Is there anything to eat?

213
15:43.890 --> 15:45.100
Why did you come back so late?

214
15:45.100 --> 15:46.560
It's way past dinner time.

215
15:47.840 --> 15:49.610
I'll make you some instant noodles.

216
15:49.610 --> 15:51.470
Instant noodles aren't healthy.

217
15:52.670 --> 15:53.980
Should we order takeout?

218
15:53.980 --> 15:54.890
No.

219
15:55.370 --> 15:56.580
Other girlfriends

220
15:56.580 --> 15:57.200
make special handmade food

221
15:57.200 --> 15:58.800
for their boyfriends to eat.

222
15:59.580 --> 16:01.080
What do you mean?

223
16:01.270 --> 16:02.480
Don't even think about it.

224
16:02.480 --> 16:03.480
What do you mean by that?

225
16:03.480 --> 16:05.270
You don't know how to cook, do you?

226
16:05.270 --> 16:06.500
Of course I do.

227
16:09.630 --> 16:10.830
I'll make you a feast.

228
16:20.030 --> 16:21.630
Why are we having instant noodles?

229
16:21.630 --> 16:23.670
I might as well have ordered takeout.

230
16:23.670 --> 16:24.600
What's the rush?

231
16:24.600 --> 16:25.860
You'll see in a minute.

232
16:54.270 --> 16:55.270
It smells so good.

233
17:02.600 --> 17:03.840
Don't eat so fast.

234
17:05.290 --> 17:06.480
It's really delicious.

235
17:06.480 --> 17:07.030
Tangy.

236
17:07.180 --> 17:07.980
How did you come up with

237
17:07.980 --> 17:08.710
such a weird—

238
17:11.500 --> 17:13.089
I mean, such an amazing combination?

239
17:13.089 --> 17:14.089
It's incredible!

240
17:15.290 --> 17:16.200
When I was in college,

241
17:16.200 --> 17:17.530
I worked at a convenience store.

242
17:17.530 --> 17:19.660
That's when I came up with this recipe.

243
17:20.069 --> 17:22.030
I was so tired back then.

244
17:22.069 --> 17:24.220
And I still had to work night shifts at the convenience store.

245
17:24.220 --> 17:26.329
Why did you have to work the night shift?

246
17:26.329 --> 17:28.190
It's so tough to stay up all night.

247
17:28.980 --> 17:30.590
The night shift paid more,

248
17:31.000 --> 17:31.790
dummy.

249
17:34.240 --> 17:35.440
Do you know what the hardest part

250
17:35.440 --> 17:36.840
about the night shift is?

251
17:36.940 --> 17:39.400
It wasn't the sleepiness. It was the hunger.

252
17:40.680 --> 17:41.570
Back then,

253
17:41.570 --> 17:43.530
all the restaurants on the street were closed.

254
17:43.530 --> 17:45.680
There weren't food deliveries at that hour too.

255
17:45.680 --> 17:47.140
So you just stayed hungry?

256
17:47.640 --> 17:49.370
That's when I came up with this.

257
17:49.590 --> 17:50.290
This convenience store sells lots of items

258
17:50.290 --> 17:52.640
that are close to their expiration dates at a discount.

259
17:52.640 --> 17:53.840
They're super cheap.

260
17:54.070 --> 17:54.900
So I just put them

261
17:54.900 --> 17:56.500
all in here and turned it

262
17:56.500 --> 17:58.100
into a big mix of everything.

263
18:02.640 --> 18:04.410
When I took the first bite,

264
18:05.380 --> 18:07.180
I felt like I'd come back to life.

265
18:08.170 --> 18:09.830
Or maybe I was just too hungry,

266
18:10.240 --> 18:11.770
so everything tasted good.

267
18:12.240 --> 18:13.030
No.

268
18:13.090 --> 18:14.420
It's really delicious.

269
18:14.980 --> 18:15.590
I think

270
18:15.590 --> 18:17.320
it's better than a grand feast.

271
18:18.880 --> 18:20.440
Then you're lucky.

272
18:20.480 --> 18:22.270
It's my signature dish.

273
18:22.940 --> 18:25.090
So I'm the first one to try it?

274
18:27.520 --> 18:28.130
Then...

275
18:28.150 --> 18:29.630
I want to keep enjoying

276
18:29.790 --> 18:31.190
Tangy's exclusive dish.

277
18:33.180 --> 18:34.910
That depends on how you behave.

278
18:51.770 --> 18:53.170
That guy ran really fast.

279
18:53.440 --> 18:55.040
He suddenly knocked me over,

280
18:55.170 --> 18:56.570
and that's how I got hurt.

281
19:01.180 --> 19:02.980
Why aren't you saying anything?

282
19:19.250 --> 19:20.970
The doctor said I'm fine.

283
19:21.500 --> 19:24.220
It's just that the gift got broken

284
19:24.220 --> 19:26.080
just moments after it was bought.

285
19:33.500 --> 19:34.700
Can we still make it

286
19:34.700 --> 19:35.960
to the restaurant now?

287
19:37.660 --> 19:39.060
We're not going anymore.

288
19:39.500 --> 19:40.900
I'll take you home first.

289
19:46.610 --> 19:48.050
Hop on. I'll carry you.

290
19:49.600 --> 19:51.400
M-My hand is hurt,

291
19:51.400 --> 19:53.160
not my legs.

292
19:54.310 --> 19:55.370
I want to carry you.

293
20:00.420 --> 20:01.220
Fine.

294
20:01.250 --> 20:02.610
No one can tell

295
20:02.610 --> 20:03.870
where I'm hurt anyway.

296
20:17.900 --> 20:18.960
Does it still hurt?

297
20:21.000 --> 20:22.720
I think this is the first time

298
20:22.720 --> 20:25.380
someone has carried me like this since I grew up.

299
20:26.550 --> 20:27.830
Probably not.

300
20:30.310 --> 20:31.440
You don't remember?

301
20:32.420 --> 20:33.220
When?

302
20:34.350 --> 20:35.880
The last time you got drunk.

303
20:37.200 --> 20:38.700
You carried me home?

304
20:40.420 --> 20:41.750
I don't remember at all.

305
20:42.260 --> 20:43.280
Then am I

306
20:43.700 --> 20:45.000
heavier than last time?

307
20:45.000 --> 20:46.600
Did I gain weight since then?

308
20:49.290 --> 20:50.090
Let me check.

309
20:51.660 --> 20:52.460
Am I heavy?

310
20:54.000 --> 20:54.790
No.

311
20:56.700 --> 20:57.550
Really?

312
20:57.920 --> 20:58.350
No.

313
20:59.700 --> 21:00.810
What a shame.

314
21:01.290 --> 21:02.660
We didn't even have dinner.

315
21:02.660 --> 21:03.750
Jiameng said it's really hard

316
21:03.750 --> 21:05.280
to get a reservation there.

317
21:07.220 --> 21:08.010
It's okay.

318
21:08.250 --> 21:10.090
We can make a reservation another time.

319
21:10.090 --> 21:11.950
I'll cook for you when we get home.

320
21:12.000 --> 21:12.850
You can cook?

321
21:15.850 --> 21:17.750
Forget it. Let's order takeout.

322
21:25.440 --> 21:26.010
Yun Lili,

323
21:28.460 --> 21:29.660
let's live together.

324
21:34.240 --> 21:34.740
The doctor said

325
21:34.740 --> 21:36.470
you need to keep your wound dry.

326
21:36.960 --> 21:39.360
I'm worried about you staying by yourself.

327
21:40.090 --> 21:40.590
I...

328
21:41.250 --> 21:41.790
I...

329
22:03.110 --> 22:04.910
You can sleep in my room tonight.

330
22:05.610 --> 22:07.720
Toiletries are in the bathroom.

331
22:09.330 --> 22:10.420
What about you?

332
22:12.510 --> 22:13.660
I need to go out again

333
22:14.040 --> 22:15.500
to take care of something.

334
22:18.210 --> 22:19.610
Go to sleep if you're tired.

335
22:19.610 --> 22:20.610
Don't wait for me.

336
22:23.770 --> 22:24.370
By the way,

337
22:24.790 --> 22:25.850
keep the wound dry.

338
22:26.080 --> 22:26.950
I know.

339
22:34.610 --> 22:35.590
It's so late.

340
22:35.750 --> 22:36.950
Wh-Where is he going?

341
22:51.790 --> 22:52.550
Shize.

342
22:54.270 --> 22:55.350
I found the guy.

343
22:55.510 --> 22:57.140
He's been caught by the police.

344
22:57.140 --> 22:58.870
Good. I'm glad they caught him.

345
25:31.470 --> 25:33.470
It's actually glued back together.

346
25:37.000 --> 25:38.250
Why aren't you wearing clothes?

347
25:38.250 --> 25:39.910
Put some clothes on right now.

348
25:42.920 --> 25:44.310
I am wearing clothes.

349
25:48.350 --> 25:50.350
I mean, proper clothes.

350
26:02.140 --> 26:03.340
Have you seen enough?

351
26:05.590 --> 26:07.200
Hurry up and change.

352
26:18.720 --> 26:19.920
Are you done?

353
26:24.940 --> 26:25.460
Done.

354
26:34.240 --> 26:35.220
Did you glue this

355
26:35.740 --> 26:37.470
aroma diffuser back together?

356
26:39.050 --> 26:40.310
I fixed it while you were asleep.

357
26:40.310 --> 26:42.970
Also, the thief who knocked you down was caught.

358
26:58.220 --> 26:59.680
You can take a closer look.

359
26:59.760 --> 27:01.720
I... I'm afraid you'll...

360
27:06.440 --> 27:07.500
Help me dry my hair.

361
27:29.240 --> 27:29.720
Your...

362
27:31.290 --> 27:33.350
your shirt isn't buttoned properly.

363
28:37.700 --> 28:39.700
Are those all models?

364
28:42.140 --> 28:43.540
They're all functional.

365
28:43.740 --> 28:45.200
If you want to try them out,

366
28:45.240 --> 28:46.240
you can take them.

367
28:46.490 --> 28:48.290
They look very expensive.

368
28:48.550 --> 28:50.640
I can't afford to replace one if I broke it.

369
28:50.640 --> 28:51.440
It's okay.

370
28:52.030 --> 28:53.230
What's mine is yours.

371
28:56.590 --> 28:57.160
Then,

372
28:57.160 --> 28:57.960
can I use them

373
28:57.960 --> 28:59.160
to record a video?

374
28:59.790 --> 29:01.530
I might need your help as well.

375
29:03.460 --> 29:04.290
Is that okay?

376
29:13.460 --> 29:14.790
Is there a reward for me?

377
29:15.940 --> 29:17.290
It's not like

378
29:17.290 --> 29:18.820
I need your help that badly.

379
29:20.960 --> 29:22.850
When my brother's in my videos,

380
29:22.850 --> 29:24.980
he doesn't ask for anything in return.

381
29:25.660 --> 29:27.050
Because he's your younger brother.

382
29:27.050 --> 29:28.250
He wouldn't dare ask.

383
29:28.250 --> 29:29.030
I don't boss my brother around

384
29:29.030 --> 29:30.480
that much, do I?

385
29:31.900 --> 29:32.420
I remember

386
29:32.420 --> 29:34.080
when you talk to your brother,

387
29:34.110 --> 29:35.870
you don't carefully ask him,

388
29:36.790 --> 29:37.650
"Is that okay?"

389
29:38.200 --> 29:40.400
That's because he's my little brother.

390
29:41.200 --> 29:42.640
But I'm your boyfriend.

391
29:44.680 --> 29:46.110
S-So?

392
29:48.400 --> 29:49.140
So you can

393
29:49.140 --> 29:50.540
be a little bossy with me.

394
29:52.790 --> 29:55.240
I... I'll try.

395
30:01.440 --> 30:02.010
Lili,

396
30:05.090 --> 30:06.330
nothing you say

397
30:07.750 --> 30:08.550
or do

398
30:09.400 --> 30:10.530
will change

399
30:11.750 --> 30:13.160
how much I like you.

400
30:16.070 --> 30:17.000
Same goes for me.

401
30:47.270 --> 30:47.930
Good night.

402
30:48.750 --> 30:49.410
Good night.

403
31:41.290 --> 31:42.200
Wh-What's up?

404
31:42.200 --> 31:42.880
Why did it take you so long

405
31:42.880 --> 31:44.010
to answer the phone?

406
31:45.090 --> 31:46.640
Where are you?

407
31:47.590 --> 31:48.570
In the restroom.

408
31:49.030 --> 31:50.210
The company restroom.

409
31:50.210 --> 31:51.530
W-What do you need?

410
31:52.900 --> 31:54.840
The Chinese New Year is coming.

411
31:54.870 --> 31:55.790
When are you coming home?

412
31:55.790 --> 31:56.220
Lili.

413
31:56.740 --> 31:57.870
Breakfast is ready.

414
31:57.960 --> 31:59.290
I-I'll be there soon.

415
32:00.510 --> 32:02.830
Why is there a man in the women's restroom?

416
32:02.830 --> 32:04.110
And that voice sounds

417
32:04.140 --> 32:05.530
a bit familiar.

418
32:05.640 --> 32:06.530
You must've misheard.

419
32:06.530 --> 32:07.700
It's a female colleague.

420
32:07.700 --> 32:08.980
Her voice is hoarse.

421
32:09.740 --> 32:11.270
She must be very sick.

422
32:11.270 --> 32:12.700
Careful, don't catch whatever she's got.

423
32:12.700 --> 32:14.070
I-If you need anything, just say it.

424
32:14.070 --> 32:14.880
If there's nothing else, I'm hanging up.

425
32:14.880 --> 32:15.630
Wait, wait.

426
32:15.740 --> 32:17.680
Come home as soon as your company breaks for the holiday.

427
32:17.680 --> 32:17.980
Got it.

428
32:17.980 --> 32:18.880
Bye-bye.

429
32:23.590 --> 32:25.190
So now I'm a female colleague

430
32:25.400 --> 32:26.530
with a hoarse voice?

431
32:26.830 --> 32:28.200
You heard that?

432
32:30.030 --> 32:30.960
Go wash up first.

433
32:31.000 --> 32:32.130
Breakfast is ready.

434
32:32.140 --> 32:32.940
I've washed up.

435
32:32.940 --> 32:34.470
I'll go have breakfast now.

436
32:52.740 --> 32:54.140
You're up so early.

437
32:57.000 --> 32:58.330
You are too, aren't you?

438
33:02.640 --> 33:05.400
This egg is perfectly fried.

439
33:07.570 --> 33:08.430
It's just okay.

440
33:15.530 --> 33:16.530
It smells so good.

441
33:20.850 --> 33:21.270
Here.

442
33:27.000 --> 33:28.500
Don't drink coffee on an empty stomach early in the morning.

443
33:28.500 --> 33:29.960
It's bad for your stomach.

444
33:30.030 --> 33:30.830
Have mine.

445
33:33.640 --> 33:34.430
Okay.

446
33:34.730 --> 33:36.190
Just in case someone says,

447
33:36.330 --> 33:37.380
"How can anyone drink

448
33:37.380 --> 33:39.240
something that tastes this bad?"

449
33:39.680 --> 33:40.090
No.

450
33:40.750 --> 33:41.770
This time,

451
33:41.800 --> 33:44.500
I'll have the one with 70% sugar.

452
33:52.570 --> 33:53.830
Don't go to work today.

453
33:54.200 --> 33:56.600
I've already put in a leave request for you.

454
33:57.790 --> 33:59.400
I'm fine now.

455
34:00.980 --> 34:02.580
Your hand hasn't healed yet.

456
34:04.090 --> 34:05.200
It's just a scratch.

457
34:05.200 --> 34:06.500
It won't affect my work.

458
34:06.500 --> 34:07.240
I'm fine.

459
34:12.630 --> 34:13.440
Lili,

460
34:14.880 --> 34:16.190
move in with me.

461
34:19.590 --> 34:21.120
I'm just worried about you.

462
34:22.040 --> 34:23.159
If you move in,

463
34:23.190 --> 34:24.650
we can go to work together.

464
34:24.670 --> 34:25.800
You'll be safer too.

465
34:30.150 --> 34:32.210
I don't want to see you get hurt again.

466
34:37.940 --> 34:38.650
Eat up.

467
34:42.389 --> 34:44.870
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

468
34:45.630 --> 34:46.980
Come by again sometime.

469
34:47.940 --> 34:48.670
Take care.

470
34:52.800 --> 34:53.500
Zhengchu,

471
34:53.500 --> 34:55.070
I left your breakfast there.

472
34:55.070 --> 34:56.070
Okay, Congsheng.

473
34:57.780 --> 34:58.570
Morning.

474
34:59.780 --> 35:00.720
Tangy is here.

475
35:00.900 --> 35:02.230
Is this prepared for me?

476
35:05.360 --> 35:06.820
You're already eating it.

477
35:08.630 --> 35:09.980
Xia, have you eaten?

478
35:09.980 --> 35:10.570
This is for you.

479
35:10.570 --> 35:11.400
This is for Congsheng.

480
35:11.400 --> 35:12.330
This one is mine.

481
35:17.300 --> 35:18.590
I'd better eat outside

482
35:18.610 --> 35:20.810
before I end up throwing up on the floor.

483
35:38.650 --> 35:40.570
Where should I start?

484
35:45.080 --> 35:47.040
This puzzle is huge.

485
35:58.030 --> 35:59.010
Did you also sit here

486
35:59.010 --> 36:00.610
and work on it for a long time?

487
36:08.590 --> 36:09.380
Yun Li,

488
36:10.640 --> 36:12.440
you're already so close

489
36:12.470 --> 36:14.110
to your moon.

490
36:14.800 --> 36:16.670
It's almost within your reach.

491
36:22.190 --> 36:23.500
A piece is missing.

492
36:29.670 --> 36:31.030
Is this moving too fast?

493
36:33.670 --> 36:34.440
Why am I acting

494
36:34.440 --> 36:36.570
like I'm already the lady of the house?

495
36:37.650 --> 36:38.920
This is his puzzle.

496
36:38.920 --> 36:39.920
I should ask him.

497
36:46.290 --> 36:48.220
Let's start with the second floor.

498
37:35.780 --> 37:38.030
Why is there only water and alcohol?

499
37:40.440 --> 37:42.340
How does he get by like this?

500
37:57.880 --> 37:58.630
Lili,

501
37:59.090 --> 37:59.940
wake up.

502
38:00.190 --> 38:01.380
Rise and shine.

503
38:03.070 --> 38:05.000
You'll be late if you don't get up.

504
38:08.400 --> 38:09.360
I'm coming in.

505
38:16.570 --> 38:17.900
Things are moving fast.

506
38:58.380 --> 38:59.380
Hello, Tangy.

507
38:59.440 --> 39:00.510
Where are you?

508
39:00.820 --> 39:03.070
I'm outside.

509
39:03.350 --> 39:04.310
Outside?

510
39:05.070 --> 39:06.660
Where exactly?

511
39:07.010 --> 39:08.670
Did you sleep well last night?

512
39:09.520 --> 39:10.510
Was the blanket warm enough?

513
39:10.510 --> 39:12.010
You didn't catch a cold, did you?

514
39:12.010 --> 39:13.540
What are you talking about?

515
39:13.670 --> 39:14.730
Yun Li,

516
39:15.110 --> 39:17.230
I am Sherlock Tangy.

517
39:17.620 --> 39:19.420
You can't hide anything from me.

518
39:19.480 --> 39:21.550
You didn't come home last night.

519
39:22.210 --> 39:24.540
Something happened between you two, huh?

520
39:25.230 --> 39:26.360
Tell me everything.

521
39:26.530 --> 39:29.610
Confess and I'll go easy on you. Resist, and you'll regret it.

522
39:29.610 --> 39:32.840
I'm at Fu Shize's place.

523
39:33.200 --> 39:35.130
You two are moving at rocket speed!

524
39:35.570 --> 39:36.480
Tell me.

525
39:36.480 --> 39:37.510
How did it go?

526
39:39.230 --> 39:40.880
Don't keep me in suspense.

527
39:41.010 --> 39:41.710
Details.

528
39:41.710 --> 39:42.820
I want details.

529
39:43.230 --> 39:43.880
Hold on!

530
39:43.880 --> 39:45.130
It's not what you think.

531
39:45.130 --> 39:47.480
S-Something just happened.

532
39:47.540 --> 39:49.310
Did you get him?

533
39:49.340 --> 39:51.440
I told you, it's not like that.

534
39:51.440 --> 39:52.440
It's just that...

535
39:53.130 --> 39:54.340
I was going to

536
39:54.340 --> 39:55.730
go out to dinner with him.

537
39:55.730 --> 39:57.440
Then I ran into a thief,

538
39:57.780 --> 39:59.230
and I hurt my hand.

539
40:00.730 --> 40:01.460
Are you okay?

540
40:01.480 --> 40:02.440
Is it serious?

541
40:02.530 --> 40:04.130
I'm fine. It's just a scrape.

542
40:05.780 --> 40:07.530
Then Fu Shize

543
40:07.530 --> 40:09.820
asked me to come live with him.

544
40:10.260 --> 40:11.570
You're moving in together?

545
40:11.570 --> 40:13.030
Who's moving in together?

546
40:13.110 --> 40:13.730
Lili.

547
40:13.730 --> 40:15.130
Let's talk when I see you later.

548
40:15.130 --> 40:15.920
Fu Zhengchu?

549
40:18.780 --> 40:20.510
If Fu Zhengchu knows,

550
40:21.680 --> 40:23.050
then Xia will know.

551
40:24.210 --> 40:25.130
If Xia knows,

552
40:25.130 --> 40:27.530
then Mr. Xu will definitely know.

553
40:27.530 --> 40:28.380
If Mr. Xu knows,

554
40:28.380 --> 40:29.380
then everyone at EAW

555
40:29.380 --> 40:29.880
will know.

556
40:29.880 --> 40:31.440
The whole world will know!

557
40:36.270 --> 40:38.400
Lili and Uncle are moving in together?

558
40:38.630 --> 40:40.710
What does that have to do with you?

559
40:42.960 --> 40:43.380
Tangy.

560
40:43.710 --> 40:44.980
Why don't you move in?

561
40:45.010 --> 40:46.200
Why would I move in?

562
40:46.480 --> 40:47.690
If Lili moves out,

563
40:47.690 --> 40:48.950
her room will be empty.

564
40:48.990 --> 40:49.870
It'd be a waste

565
40:49.900 --> 40:50.440
to leave it empty.

566
40:50.440 --> 40:52.030
Why don't you move in?

567
40:52.070 --> 40:53.980
It'll make your commute easier.

568
40:54.980 --> 40:57.170
So you're worried about the rent.

569
40:57.510 --> 40:58.420
Of course not.

570
40:58.820 --> 40:59.320
I was thinking

571
40:59.320 --> 41:00.480
it's hard for you

572
41:00.480 --> 41:01.340
to commute back and forth every day,

573
41:01.340 --> 41:02.600
whatever the weather.

574
41:06.090 --> 41:07.710
You know how to care for people?

575
41:07.710 --> 41:08.510
Of course.

576
41:09.840 --> 41:10.980
And if you move in,

577
41:10.980 --> 41:12.380
we can see each other more often.

578
41:12.380 --> 41:13.640
Wouldn't that be nice?

579
41:14.760 --> 41:16.160
Y-You call that nice?

580
41:16.630 --> 41:18.040
You just want me to be your

581
41:18.070 --> 41:19.320
24-hour nanny.

582
41:19.570 --> 41:20.840
In your dreams.

583
41:21.100 --> 41:22.390
Of course not.

584
41:23.530 --> 41:25.130
Give it some consideration.

585
41:25.340 --> 41:26.510
Stop talking nonsense.

586
41:26.510 --> 41:27.670
Hurry up and go to school.

587
41:27.670 --> 41:28.730
I have to go to work.

588
41:29.380 --> 41:30.240
Think about it.

589
41:31.440 --> 41:32.780
Get out of the way.

590
41:33.400 --> 41:34.010
Okay.

591
41:34.130 --> 41:35.260
I'm going to school.

592
41:35.610 --> 41:36.420
Bye-bye.

593
41:36.780 --> 41:37.680
Think about it.

594
42:04.420 --> 42:06.550
Is this calendar just for decoration?

595
42:07.940 --> 42:08.940
March 8th.

596
42:08.940 --> 42:10.320
It's already January.

597
42:24.880 --> 42:25.570
Shize,

598
42:25.570 --> 42:26.980
the work plan for February and March

599
42:26.980 --> 42:27.570
is out.

600
42:27.570 --> 42:29.230
Please review and confirm it.

601
42:34.500 --> 42:36.710
[March 8, Light Chaser Global Launch Event]

602
42:39.480 --> 42:40.480
I have plans

603
42:41.280 --> 42:42.070
on March 8th.

604
42:42.910 --> 42:44.770
Do you have a date that day, Shize?

605
42:45.030 --> 42:45.730
I'll leave the press conference

606
42:45.730 --> 42:47.190
arrangements to you guys.

607
42:48.010 --> 42:48.780
Shize,

608
42:48.820 --> 42:50.710
you made a major contribution to Light Chaser.

609
42:50.710 --> 42:52.190
If you don't come

610
42:52.210 --> 42:53.050
on a day worth celebrating...

611
42:53.050 --> 42:53.760
Chen.

612
42:55.210 --> 42:56.440
I'm not available that day.

613
42:56.440 --> 42:57.360
Shize, but...

614
42:57.380 --> 42:58.110
Chen.

615
42:59.920 --> 43:00.850
Get back to work.

616
43:00.920 --> 43:01.880
Okay, Mr. Xu.

617
43:11.530 --> 43:12.480
It's my fault.

618
43:12.880 --> 43:14.840
I should've checked more carefully.

619
43:14.840 --> 43:16.390
I know March 8th

620
43:16.420 --> 43:18.150
is the day you visit Jiang Yuan.

621
43:18.420 --> 43:20.420
Don't worry about the press conference.

622
43:20.420 --> 43:22.080
We can change the date, right?

623
43:22.780 --> 43:24.440
Just let me know once it's set.

624
43:25.510 --> 43:26.230
No need.

625
43:28.880 --> 43:31.130
Light Chaser is the result of all our hard work.

626
43:31.130 --> 43:33.390
Everyone is looking forward to that day.

627
43:33.860 --> 43:34.700
Don't let my personal affairs

628
43:34.700 --> 43:36.300
become a burden to everyone.

629
43:37.060 --> 43:37.780
Let the press conference

630
43:37.780 --> 43:38.890
proceed as usual.

631
43:39.150 --> 43:40.070
I'll take care of

632
43:40.070 --> 43:41.930
my personal matters beforehand.

633
43:43.480 --> 43:44.280
Okay.

634
43:44.380 --> 43:45.170
Get back to work.
